(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[13] = {"n": 13, "title": "Sentence and Phrase Roles", "ar": "مَحَلُّ الجُمْلَةِ وَشِبْهِ الجُمْلَةِ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>This module asks two questions together: what is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> <b>inside</b> an expression, and what role does the <b>whole expression</b> occupy? Work in that order, then connect the two answers.</p><p>Recall <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ، خبر، فاعل، نائب فاعل، مفعول به، حال، نعت، مضاف إليه، شرط، جواب، عامل، معمول</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></b> describes the state of its <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span></b>; a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span></b> describes its <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> referring back to an earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span></b> identifies something particular; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span></b> does not. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> already qualified, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مؤمن</span>, is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير محضة</span></b>; an unqualified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة محضة</span></b>.</p><p>For endings: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ الشرطية</span></b> can give a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع جزم</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span></b> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع صحيح الآخر مفرد</span> shows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة، فتحة، سكون</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ، لن يكتبَ، لم يكتبْ</span></b>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبوت النون</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجزم</span> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبونَ، لن يكتبوا، لم يكتبوا</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضميرًا في محل رفع فاعل</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماضٍ</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيًّا</span> even when its position is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة</span></b> here includes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span></b> links it to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو</span></b> attaches to a specific action or meaning, expressed or understood; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span></b> attaches to an omitted general meaning such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كائن</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستقرّ</span>. These labels apply to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> too; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغو</span> does not mean useless.</p><p>Every question or table row has one correct choice. When two analyses are allowed, an option may state both, or the question specifies which analysis to use. Attempt the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> before opening the worked solution.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "The whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Core rule</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> that is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة لها محل من الإعراب</span></b>. Its role may come directly from a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> or through another expression. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> that is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة لا محل لها من الإعراب</span></b>. This last description never means that its individual words lack <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة المعمولة بالأصالة</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلها</span></th><th>Example; analyse the bracketed words</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر المبتدأ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ [يقرأُ الكتابَ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا [يقرأُ الكتابَ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به، ومنه مقول القول</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال خالدٌ: [الكتابُ نافعٌ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول له: جملة تعليلية</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واتّقوا اللهَ [لعلّكم تفلحون</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ [وهو يضحكُ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر الفعل الناقص</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ [يقرأُ الكتابَ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أذكرُ يومَ [حضرَ خالدٌ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط الجازم المقترن برابطة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ [فأنتَ ناجحٌ</span>]</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقول القول، مقول، مقولة</span></b> name what is said. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة تعليلية</span></b> supplies a reason or purpose; in the example with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّ</span>, the whole expression occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول له</span>. Do not classify every occurrence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّ</span> this way without considering the relationship.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كانَ خالدٌ يقرأُ الكتابَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid was reading the book.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان: فعل ماض ناقص مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ: اسم كان مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ: فعل مضارع مرفوع بالضمة؛ فاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره هو، يعود إلى خالد</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ الكتاب: جملة فعلية في محل نصب خبر كان</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> of the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> does not change <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأَ</span>.</li><li>The complete statement, when it opens the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span>, is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية لا محل لها</span>.</li></ul><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال خالدٌ: إنّ الكتابَ نافعٌ</span></b>, the whole <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الكتاب نافع</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مقول القول</span>; inside it, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافعٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the highlighted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> to its role. Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> first.", "sol": "<p>The roles are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر المبتدأ، خبر إنّ، خبر كان، مقول القول</span></b>. Their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محال</span> are respectively <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع، رفع، نصب، نصب</span></b>. In all three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب</span> examples the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> itself is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع؛</span> its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is a hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ</span></b>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: صلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر المبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ</span></b>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب اسم إنّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ</span></b>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: جواب قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب خبر كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع اسم كان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال خالدٌ</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصدقُ نافعٌ</span></b>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل قال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مقول القول</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا يقرأُ الكتابَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبّه بالفعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها منصوب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع وفاعله مستتر هو؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ الكتاب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>. If this complete statement opens the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span>, the outer statement is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية لا محل لها</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبّه بالفعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وفاعله الكتاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة وفاعله مستتر هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بإنّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ الكتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل نصب اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة لا محل لها: صلة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كانت هندٌ <span class=\"blank\"></span> الرسالةَ</span></b> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبُ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هي</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتب الرسالة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب خبر كانت</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span> does not directly give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> inside its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبُ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال المسافر: الطريق طويل. أذكر يوم وصلنا. واتّقوا الله لعلّكم تفلحون</span>.</b> Match each target to its role, using the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة تعليلية</span> analysis for the last.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطريق طويل</span></b> supplies what <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافر</span> said. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصلنا</span></b> completes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة يوم إلى الجملة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّكم تفلحون</span></b> gives the purpose as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة تعليلية في محل نصب مفعول له</span>. Inside it, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم اسم لعلّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفلحون</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبرها</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفلحون مرفوع بثبوت النون، والواو فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطريق طويل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مقول القول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصلنا، بعد يوم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: جواب القسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مقول القول</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّكم تفلحون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول له: جملة تعليلية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct this claim: “A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span> must contain a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل منصوب</span>.”", "sol": "<p>Identify the internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> separately: in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالد يقرأُ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>, while <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span></b> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب خبر كان</span>.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.", "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> can never be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span>.", "The whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> and its individual words have separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> relationships."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسمّى المعمول من الجملة جملة لها محل من الإعراب</span>.</b> What must you establish?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعمول</span></b> directs attention to the whole expression and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>. The final word alone cannot tell you whether the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرًا، حالًا</span> or another role.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The role and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.", "Only whether its first word is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.", "Only the ending of its final word."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة الحال</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span>", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">Connect the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span></h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة حالية</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span>. Its link may involve a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير عائد, واو الحال</span>, or both, under the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ خالدٌ يضحكُ</span></b> has an understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضحك</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ خالدٌ والشمسُ طالعةٌ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span>; the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span> is required</h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة حالية</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ والشمسُ طالعةٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span> begins with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ وهو يضحكُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة مضارعية</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِمَ تؤذونني وقد تعلمون أنّي رسول الله إليكم</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> is narrower than “every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span>.” Compare a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> whose first word is the referring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> with one whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span> occurs later.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span> is excluded</h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></th><th>Example; identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> without adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>It already follows a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاطف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فجاءها بأسنا بياتًا أو هم قائلون: هم قائلون</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أو</span></td></tr><tr><td>It confirms the meaning of the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلك الكتاب لا ريب فيه: لا ريب فيه</span>, on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكدة</span> analysis</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة ماضية</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وما يأتيهم من نبيّ إلّا كانوا به يستهزئون</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة ماضية</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أو</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنصفِ الناسَ أنصفوك أو ظلموك</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مثبت</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ يضحكُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منفي بما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عهدتُك ما تصبرُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منفي بلا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ لا يضحكُ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>These are rules about <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span></b>. They do not ban a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> with another function elsewhere. The analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ريب فيه</span> is not the only possible analysis of that expression; use the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكدة</span> analysis here.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s4\">Permitted forms and preferences</h2><p>Outside those <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>, both forms may occur. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b>, compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجع خالدٌ ولم يتعبْ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجع خالدٌ لم يتعبْ</span></b>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> is preferred. In a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية, واو</span> is usual unless one of the specific rules decides the matter; omission also occurs, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقلنا اهبطوا بعضكم لبعض عدوّ</span></b>.</p><p>For a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماضٍ مثبت</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> is usual: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ وقد تعبَ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> alone also occurs, as does omission of both, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذه بضاعتنا رُدَّتْ إلينا</span></b> on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رُدّت إلينا</span>. An alternative account requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> to be expressed or understood in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال ماضية</span>. Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غالب</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span></b>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s5\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ خالدٌ وهو يضحكُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid came laughing.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء: فعل ماض؛ خالدٌ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو: واو الحال، لا محل لها</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو: ضمير منفصل في محل رفع مبتدأ، يعود إلى خالد</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضحكُ: مضارع مرفوع بالضمة؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره هو</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضحك: جملة فعلية في محل رفع خبر هو</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يضحك: جملة اسمية في محل نصب حال من خالد</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع</span> can sit inside another with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span>.</li></ul></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s6\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "Connect the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span> is required"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span> is excluded"}, {"id": "L2-s4", "title": "Permitted forms and preferences"}, {"id": "L2-s5", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s6", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the reason why <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span> is required.", "sol": "<p>The three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدم العائد، تصدير الاسمية بضمير صاحب الحال، اقتران المضارعية بقد</span></b>. In the second example <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> already refers to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>, yet the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> still requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ والشمسُ طالعةٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عائد في الجملة الحالية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال بعد عاطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مثبت بلا قد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ وهو يضحكُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ضمير في الجملة إطلاقًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمية مصدّرة بضمير صاحب الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض بعد إلّا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِمَ تؤذونني وقد تعلمون أنّي رسول الله إليكم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارعية منفية بما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض قبل أو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارعية مقترنة بقد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify why no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span> is added to the target <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>.", "sol": "<p>Each target meets an exclusion: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثبت بلا قد، منفي بما، منفي بلا، ماض قبل أو، ماض بعد إلّا</span></b> respectively. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> in each target connects it to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ يضحكُ: يضحك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مثبت بغير قد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مقترن بقد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عائد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عهدتُك ما تصبرُ: ما تصبر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة مصدّرة بضمير صاحب الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منفي بما</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ لا يضحكُ: لا يضحك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض قبل أو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منفي بلا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنصف الناسَ أنصفوك أو ظلموك: أنصفوك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض قبل أو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مع قد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وما يأتيهم من نبيّ إلّا كانوا به يستهزئون: كانوا</span>...", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض بعد إلّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منفي بلم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عادَ الحارسُ <span class=\"blank\"></span> هو متعبٌ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارس</span> = guard; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعب</span> = tired.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاد الحارسُ وهو متعبٌ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span> begins with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span> is required. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو مبتدأ؛ متعبٌ خبر؛ هو متعب في محل نصب حال</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أوْ</span>", "No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> is permitted here.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وَ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the accurate judgement. Each target is being analysed as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b> permits both forms; with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> is preferred. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مثبت</span> usually has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو وقد</span>, but other attested patterns occur. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكدة</span> and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> already following a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاطف</span> exclude <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span>. Respect the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ريب فيه</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجع خالدٌ لم يتعبْ / رجع خالدٌ ولم يتعبْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما جائز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو ممتنعة مع لم دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو واجبة مع لم دائمًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ وقد تعبَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل حال ماضية بلا واو خطأ قطعًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو مع قد ممنوعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو مع قد هي الغالب في الماضي المثبت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلك الكتاب لا ريب فيه، على تحليل لا ريب فيه حالًا مؤكدة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمتنع واو الحال هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يجوز هذا التحليل أصلًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجب واو الحال هنا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بياتًا أو هم قائلون: هم قائلون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تضاف واو الحال بعد العاطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أو حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجب واو بعد أو</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2R", "type": "grid", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ وهو يقرأُ</span></b>, distinguish the two levels.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span></b> is internally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع؛</span> its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر هو في محل رفع</span>. The larger <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يقرأ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال من خالد في محل نصب. خالدٌ</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل جاء</span>.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ، مع فاعله المستتر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: صلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال من خالد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل جاء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ نفسه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب لأن الحال منصوبة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغالب في الماضية المثبتة الواو مع قد</span>.</b> Does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغالب</span> make every other form wrong?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغالب</span></b> describes the usual form. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال ماضية</span> may show <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> alone or neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> nor expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span>; an alternative account supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد تقديرًا</span> where it is not expressed.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم؛ الغالب والواجب حكم واحد</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم؛ قد لا تأتي إلا مع المضارع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا؛ الغالب غير الواجب</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">The boundary of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span></h2><p>The <b>whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم</span> when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> is introduced by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الجواب</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span></b>. Otherwise, distinguish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ تنجحْ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنجحْ فعل مجزوم؛ جملة تنجح لا محل لها، إذ لا رابطة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ فأنتَ ناجحٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت ناجح: في محل جزم جواب الشرط، مقترن بالفاء</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ فسوف تنجحُ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف تنجح: في محل جزم؛ تنجحُ</span> itself remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو اجتهدتَ لنجحتَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب شرط غير جازم، لا محل له</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الجواب</span> is required</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span></th><th>Example after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ</span>, unless a fuller example is shown</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فأنت ناجح</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جامد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعسى اللهُ أن ينفعَك</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل طلبي: أمر أو نهي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فأبشرْ / فلا تكسلْ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مثبت</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span>, expressed or understood</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن يسرقْ فقد سرق أخٌ له من قبل؛ إن كان قميصه قُدَّ من قُبُلٍ فصدقتْ، أي فقد صدقت</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض منفي بما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن لم تفعلْ فما بلّغتَ رسالتَه</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سـ</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فستنجحُ / فسوف تنجحُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منفي بلن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلن تندمَ</span></td></tr><tr><td>Begins with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كأنّما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ومن يشركْ بالله فكأنّما خرّ من السماء</span></td></tr><tr><td>Begins with another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة شرط</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن جئتَ فإن احتجتَ كتابًا أعطيتُكَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير قد</span> concerns the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض متصرّف</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جامد</span> does not need that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> expressing an already established fact is different from the unmarked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> used as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>'s outcome.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> is optional or excluded</h2><p>With an ordinary <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مثبت</span></b> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تنفيس</span>, either use the direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> or introduce the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>. Both routes also occur with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا النافية</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ لا تندمْ / فلا تندمُ</span></b>. Do not confuse this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا تكسلْ</span></b>.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> is excluded in the unmarked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض جواب</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن أحسنتَ أحسنتَ لنفسك</span></b>. This also covers a past meaning expressed by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن خرجتَ لم أخرجْ</span></b>. Do not turn the qualified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> rule into “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> is impossible before every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span>.”</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span></b> can replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> after <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وإن تصبهم سيّئة بما قدّمت أيديهم إذا هم يقنطون</span></b>. Here the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطية جازمة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فجائية</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم يقنطون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم جواب الشرط</span>. If the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> itself uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا غير الجازمة</span>, its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span> merely because it contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ تجتهدْ فلن تندمَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">If you work hard, you will not regret it.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ: حرف شرط جازم؛ تجتهدْ: مضارع مجزوم بالسكون، فعل الشرط؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنت</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء: رابطة للجواب؛ لن: حرف نفي ونصب واستقبال</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تندمَ: مضارع منصوب بالفتحة بلن؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنت</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تندم: جملة في محل جزم جواب الشرط</span>. The outer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> does not cancel the inner <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</li></ul></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s5\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "The boundary of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الجواب</span> is required"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> is optional or excluded"}, {"id": "L3-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s5", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Assign a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> to the entire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>, not just its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.", "sol": "<p>In the first, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنجحْ</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجزوم</span>, but its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> because the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> lacks a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة</span>. In the second, a linked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير جازمة</span>, so its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ تنجحْ: تنجح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم لوجود الفاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: جواب جازم بلا رابطة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ فأنت ناجحٌ: أنت ناجح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم جواب شرط جازم مقترن بالفاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: جواب غير جازم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو جئتَ لأكرمتُك: لأكرمتك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم جواب إن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: جواب شرط غير جازم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Why does this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبشرْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف</span></b> introduce two other required forms<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما بلّغت</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض منفي بما؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جامد</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> beginning with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كأنّما</span></b> or with another <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة شرط</span></b> also requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>. Do not confuse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا النافية</span>, where two forms can occur, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية</span>, which produces a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب طلبي</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ فأبشرْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواب ماض بلا قد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواب طلبي: أمر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ فلن تندمَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منفي بلن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بلن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض منفي بلم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ فسوف تنجحُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مجرد من قد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مقترن بحرف تنفيس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة موصول</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن لم تفعلْ فما بلّغتَ رسالتَه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مثبت بلا قد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض منفي بما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت جملة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ فعسى الله أن ينفعك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جامد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منفي بلا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ومن يشرك بالله فكأنّما خرّ من السماء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كأنّما فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواب مضارع مجرد من حرف تنفيس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواب مصدّر بكأنّما</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن جئتَ فإن احتجتَ كتابًا أعطيتُكَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواب مصدّر بأداة شرط أخرى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعطيتك نعت لكتاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن الثانية حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the endings in the connected statement <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تحفظ القاعدة فسوف تطبقها، وإن تجتهد فلن تندم</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحفظ</span> = retain; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تطبّق</span> = apply.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تحفظْ القاعدةَ فسوف تطبّقُها، وإن تجتهدْ فلن تندمَ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجزم فعل الشرط؛ سوف لا تنصب ولا تجزم؛ لن تنصب</span>. Each linked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم</span>, despite the different internal endings.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحفظ، بعد إن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحفظُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحفظَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحفظْ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تطبّق، بعد فسوف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تطبّقْها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تطبّقَها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تطبّقُها</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تندم، بعد فلن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تندمُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تندمْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تندمَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the accurate contrast: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ لا تندمْ / إن تجتهدْ فلا تندمُ</span></b>. Both instances of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية</span>.", "sol": "<p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا النافية</span></b> the direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> may show <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> on its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span>; with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span> and the internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية</span></b> is different: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا تكسلْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلبي</span> and requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["The second is wrong because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل جواب</span> must have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> on its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.", "Both are permitted: first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جواب مجزوم</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة لا محل لها</span>; second linked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل جزم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تندمُ مرفوع</span>.", "The first must contain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناهية</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3R", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Check the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>, including the less common forms.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصدقت</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> understood with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض متصرّف</span>. The ordinary unmarked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم أخرج</span></b> do not take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> in these constructions. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span></b> replaces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> here, giving the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب محل جزم</span>. After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الشرطية غير الجازمة</span>, the same conclusion about <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> would not follow.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن كان قميصه قُدّ من قُبُل فصدقت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدقت مضارع مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد مقدّرة قبل صدقت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء ممنوعة قبل كل ماض</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن أحسنتَ أحسنتَ لنفسك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب ماض بلا قد؛ لا تضاف الفاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء واجبة حُذفت خطأ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن خرجتَ لم أخرجْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب ماض معنى بلم، بلا فاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء واجبة قبل لم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تصبهم سيّئة إذا هم يقنطون: هم يقنطون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم؛ إذا فجائية رابطة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر؛ إذا حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال بلا جواب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط الجازم المقترن برابطة في محل جزم</span>.</b> Which claim follows?", "sol": "<p>Both qualifications matter. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> by itself is insufficient, and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجزوم</span> is not proof that its entire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجازم والمقترن برابطة شرطان للحكم المذكور</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل فعل في الجواب منصوب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل جملة فيها فاء في محل جزم</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة المعمولة بالتبعية</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">Three routes</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> may receive its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> through <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت، بدل، عطف</span></b>. Find its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> before assigning the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Relationship</th><th>Example</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل الجملة</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر رجلٌ يقرأُ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ: رفع نعت لرجل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ رجلًا يقرأُ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ: نصب نعت لرجل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ برجلٍ يقرأُ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ: جر نعت لرجل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل من جملة لها محل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نجّيناكم من آل فرعون يسومونكم سوء العذاب يذبّحون أبناءكم</span></td><td>On <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسومونكم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال, يذبّحون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل منها في محل نصب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوفة على جملة لها محل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال خالدٌ: العلمُ نافعٌ والعملُ لازمٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العمل لازم: نصب، معطوفة على مقول القول</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> can also be <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدلًا من مفرد</span></b>, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفلا ينظرون إلى الإبل كيف خُلقت</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف خُلقت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر بدل اشتمال من الإبل</span> in this analysis. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُلقت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مجهول</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span> is the hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هي</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإبل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> brings the manner of their creation into focus.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت جملة</span></h2><p>There must be a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير عائد إلى المنعوت</span></b>, expressed or understood. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل يقرأ</span>, the hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> provides it. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span> must be <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة محضة، نكرة غير محضة، أو في حكم النكرة</span></b>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ صالحٌ يقرأُ</span></b> still permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كمثل الحمار يحمل أسفارًا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحمار</span> denotes the kind, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حكم النكرة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحمل أسفارًا</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعتًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسفار</span></b> means books. A visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> is not by itself a sufficient reason to reject the stated analysis.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ برجلٍ يحملُ كتابًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I passed a man carrying a book.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ: مرّ فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء: حرف جر؛ رجلٍ: اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحملُ: مضارع مرفوع بالضمة؛ فاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره هو، وهو العائد إلى رجل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحمل كتابًا: جملة فعلية في محل جر نعت لرجل</span>. It follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> without turning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحمل</span> into a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجرور</span>.</li></ul></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s4\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "Three routes"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت جملة</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت جملة</span> to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> follows <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء, نصب</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت, جر</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>. In every case <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحملُ</span> is internally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> and the hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء رجلٌ يحمل كتابًا: يحمل كتابًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع نعت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ رجلًا يحمل كتابًا: يحمل كتابًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ برجلٍ يحمل كتابًا: يحمل كتابًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ برجلٍ يقرأُ</span></b>, what supplies the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو المستتر في يقرأ</span></b> links the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل. تاء مررت</span> refers to the speaker; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء</span> cannot be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير عائد</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء لأنها حرف جر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يقرأ المستتر، تقديره هو، يعود إلى رجل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء مررت لأنها تعود إلى رجل</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the complete analysis of each highlighted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>, using the stated relationships.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوفة</span> inherits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقول القول</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف خُلقت</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة بدل اشتمال من الإبل</span>, so it inherits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. Given <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسومونكم</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال في محل نصب</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يذبّحون أبناءكم</span></b> is also <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قالت هند: الطريق آمن</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والباب مفتوح</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ عطف على مقول القول</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب بالعطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع لأن مفتوح مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها مهما كان المتبوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفلا ينظرون إلى الإبل</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف خُلقت</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ بدل اشتمال من الإبل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر بدل من مفرد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسومونكم سوء العذاب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يذبّحون أبناءكم</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ الأولى حال والثانية بدل منها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثانية مجرورة بيذبّحون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثانية في محل رفع نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثانية في محل نصب بدل من جملة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كمثل الحمار يحمل أسفارًا</span></b>, choose the reason that permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحمل أسفارًا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحمار</span></b> denotes the kind, placing it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حكم النكرة</span> in this analysis. The hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحمل</span> returns to it. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسفارًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> must take a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسفارًا</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span> because it follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحمل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحمار للجنس، فهو في حكم النكرة، وفي يحمل ضمير عائد</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بطالبٍ يحفظُ النصَّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحفظ النص</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"blank\"></span></span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحفظُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"blank\"></span></span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبٍ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالباء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>; the describing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> with its hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت في محل جر</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> does not become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا</span> because the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> describes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها؛ ماض مبني</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت؛ مضارع مرفوع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال؛ مضارع مجرور</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير عائد إلى المنعوت لفظًا أو تقديرًا</span>.</b> Which example satisfies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديرًا</span>?", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل يكتب</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> has a hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> does not require a separately written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ: لا جملة بعده</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ في السوق: السوق ضمير مستتر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ يكتبُ: الفاعل المستتر هو</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجمل التي لا محل لها</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">Eight categories</h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة</span></th><th>How to recognise it</th><th>Example; target in brackets</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية</span></td><td>Opens the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span></td><td>[<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَ خالدٌ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستأنفة</span></td><td>Continues the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span> without receiving a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> from what precedes</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتهد زيدٌ [ونجحَ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span></td><td>Completes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الذي [يقرأُ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معترضة</span></td><td>Inserted between connected parts</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ، [وأنت قادرٌ]، تنجحْ</span>; here intended as an inserted reassurance</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية</span></td><td>Explains earlier wording</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أشرتُ إليه [أنِ اجلسْ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span></td><td>States what is affirmed by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ [لأصدقنَّ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب شرط غير جازم، أو جازم بلا رابطة</span></td><td>No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span>, or no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء/إذا رابطة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو جئتَ [لأكرمتُكَ]؛ إن تجتهدْ [تنجحْ</span>]</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابعة لما لا محل له</span></td><td>Follows a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> with no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الذي يقرأُ [ويكتبُ</span>]</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستأنفة</span></b> can overlap in usage; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستأنفة</span> may name a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية</span> too. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستأنفة</span> may be joined by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> or occur without one. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب النداء</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستأنف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا خالدُ، اجتهدْ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span> also falls under this broad use of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استئناف</span>, though it has its own category above.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف الاستئناف</span> include <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو، الفاء، ثمّ، حتى، أم المنقطعة، بل الانتقالية، أو بمعنى بل، لكن المجرّدة عن الواو</span></b>. Identify the use in context; not every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للاستئناف</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة، تفسير، اعتراض</span></h2><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الذي يقرأُ</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span></b> has a role: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل في محل رفع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها</span>. Its hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span>. One alternative account gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> through following the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>; use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل</span> account in exercises unless told otherwise.</p><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية</span> may have <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ التفسيرية</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيْ</span></b>, or no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تفسير</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولمّا يأتكم مثل الذين خلوا من قبلكم مسّتهم البأساء والضرّاء</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسّتهم البأساء والضرّاء</span> explains the previous account. An alternative analysis treats a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تفسير</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span>. Do not offer those as competing “right” choices in an unspecified question.</p><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معترضة</span> is identified by its inserted role, not punctuation alone: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإن لم تفعلوا ولن تفعلوا فاتّقوا النار</span></b> has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولن تفعلوا</span></b> between <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب, لا محل لها</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ الذي يقرأُ ويكتبُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The one who reads and writes came.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء: فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي: اسم موصول مبني على السكون في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ: مضارع مرفوع؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره هو، عائد إلى الذي</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ: صلة الموصول لا محل لها</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو: حرف عطف؛ يكتبُ: مضارع مرفوع وفاعله مستتر تقديره هو</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب: جملة معطوفة على صلة لا محل لها، فلا محل لها أيضًا</span>.</li><li>The whole statement is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية لا محل لها</span> when it opens the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span>.</li></ul></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s4\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "Eight categories"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة، تفسير، اعتراض</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> to the most specific label supplied by its context.", "sol": "<p>The contexts establish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتداء، جواب نداء، صلة، اعتراض، تفسير</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنِ</span></b> in the final example is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ التفسيرية</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> prevents <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التقاء الساكنين</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجلس</span>. It does not create a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل</span> here.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر خالد، في بدء الكلام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب قسم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا خالد، اجتهدْ: اجتهد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستأنفة: جواب النداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الذي يكتب: يكتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإن لم تفعلوا ولن تفعلوا فاتقوا النار: ولن تفعلوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معترضة لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل مجرور</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أشرت إليه أنِ اجلسْ: اجلس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب شرط جازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل في محل جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the central relationships in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الذي يقرأُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span></b> occupies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> role; its <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span></b> does not share that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> in the analysis used here. The hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يقرأ</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع وفاعله مستتر هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل منصوب بالذي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به جاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها في التحليل المعتمد هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل بدل الذي</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل الضيف. إنّ الطريق طويل</span>.</b> The second statement starts a fresh explanation, not reported speech. Its whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is:", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الطريق طويل</span></b> is a fresh explanation with no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> from the first statement. Inside it, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطريقَ اسم إنّ منصوب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طويلٌ خبر إنّ مرفوع</span>. A semantic connection does not require a shared <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> relationship.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستأنفة لا محل لها</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مقول القول</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر الضيف</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها</span> account. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الذي يفهم ويشرح</span></b>, what is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يشرح</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفهم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يشرح</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوفة عليها</span>, so it too has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارعان</span> are internally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعان</span> with a hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع لأن الذي فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب لأن الواو تنصب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها؛ معطوفة على صلة لا محل لها</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which statement preserves the acknowledged alternative analyses?", "sol": "<p>Keep the chosen account consistent. The default here is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية لا محل لها</span></b>; the alternatives are identified rather than silently mixed into that analysis.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["The main account gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>; another treats it as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابعة للموصول</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تفسير</span> may alternatively be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدلًا</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية</span> contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ المصدرية</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span> regardless of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصول</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقطعة عمّا قبلها إعرابًا</span>.</b> What does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعرابًا</span> limit?", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستأنفة</span> may explain or develop an earlier meaning without being its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر، حال، نعت</span> or another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["No word in the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>.", "The second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> must be meaningless.", "The separation concerns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>; the meanings can still connect."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القسم</span>, its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Build the structure</h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُقسمُ باللهِ لأصدقنَّ في الحديثِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I swear by Allah that I will speak truthfully.</span></div><p>The three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل القسم</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقسم</span>), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقسم به</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالله</span>), and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقسم عليه</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأصدقنّ في الحديث</span>), also called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل القسم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقسم به</span> together are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القسم</span></b>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل القسم</span> is understood.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. It can begin with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الثقيلة، إنْ المخففة، قد، اللام المفتوحة، ما النافية، لا النافية</span></b>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والله إنّ الصدقَ نافعٌ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والله ما كذبتُ</span></b>. The opening determines the internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>; the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل له</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></h2><p>In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مثبت جواب</span> considered here, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> is required when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> directly follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام القسم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ لأكتبنَّ</span></b>. It is excluded when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفي</span>, when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> is absent, or when a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاصل</span> separates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ لا أكذبُ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولسوف يعطيك ربّك فترضى</span></b>. Do not transfer the rule to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كذبتُ</span>.</p><p>There are two accounts of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولسوف يعطيك ربك</span></b>: a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> is understood before it, or it is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الابتداء</span></b> without an understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>. On the first account <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف</span> separates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعطي</span>. Also recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام الموطئة للقسم</span></b> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَئِنْ</span></b>: it signals a preceding understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> meet</h2><p>In the construction studied here, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواب للسابق منهما</span></b>: the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> belongs to the earlier one, and the later one's <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> is omitted because the first indicates it. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماضٍ لفظًا</span>, or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماضٍ معنًى</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ إنْ جئتَ لأكرمنَّكَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم؛ جواب الشرط محذوف</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ جئتَ واللهِ أكرمتُكَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط؛ جواب القسم محذوف</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَئِنْ أُخرجوا لا يخرجون معهم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم المحذوف؛</span> therefore <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يخرجون</span> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Do not change <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يخرجون</span></b> to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يخرجوا</span></b> merely because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> occurs earlier. Likewise, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما لك من الله من وليّ ولا نصير</span></b> after <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولئن اتّبعت أهواءهم</span>...</b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span>; it does not need <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الجواب</span> as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية جوابًا للشرط</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ إنْ جئتَ لأكرمنَّكَ</span>.</b></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو: حرف قسم وجر؛ اللهِ: مجرور بالكسرة؛ القسم</span> precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشرط</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ: حرف شرط جازم؛ جئتَ: فعل ماض مبني على السكون في محل جزم فعل الشرط؛ التاء فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام: لام جواب القسم؛ أكرمنّ: مضارع مبني على الفتح لاتصاله المباشر بنون التوكيد الثقيلة؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنا؛ النون حرف توكيد لا محل له</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف: ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأكرمنّك: جواب القسم لا محل له؛ جواب الشرط محذوف لدلالة جواب القسم عليه</span>.</li></ul></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s5\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Build the structure"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> meet"}, {"id": "L6-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s5", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقسمُ باللهِ لأصدقنَّ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقسم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل القسم؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالله</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقسم به؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأصدقنّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقسم عليه أي جواب القسم، لا محل له</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصدقنّ</span> the hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتوكيد</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقسم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقسم عليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل القسم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقسم به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأصدقنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقسم عليه، وهو جواب القسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جملة لأصدقنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the judgement about <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> in the stated forms.", "sol": "<p>Direct <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مثبت</span></b> in the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا أكذب</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفي</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لسوف يعطيك</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف</span> separates <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> on the understood-<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> account; the alternative <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الابتداء</span> account does not posit that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ لأكتبنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجبة مع المضارع المثبت المتصل باللام هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممنوعة لأن اللام موجودة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ لا أكذبُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحذف لا وتضاف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجبة مع كل قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممتنعة هنا لأن الجواب منفي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولسوف يعطيك ربك، على تقدير القسم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا نون توكيد للفصل بسوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد واجبة رغم سوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعطيك مجزوم بلام القسم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Determine which earlier construction owns the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>.", "sol": "<p>Apply <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجواب للسابق منهما</span></b>. In the first, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القسم</span> precedes; in the second, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشرط</span> precedes. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لئن</span></b> signals a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> understood before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span>, so <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يخرجون</span></b> answers it and retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والله إن جئت لأكرمنّك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط؛ جواب القسم محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقول القول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم؛ جواب الشرط محذوف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن جئت والله أكرمتك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم؛ جواب الشرط محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط؛ جواب القسم محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت جملة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لئن أُخرجوا لا يخرجون معهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوبة بلا شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم المقدّر قبل إن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب إن المجزوم بحذف النون</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct the ending in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لئن أُخرجوا لا يخرجوا معهم</span></b>, preserving the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يخرجون</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا نافية؛ يخرجون مضارع مرفوع بثبوت النون والواو فاعل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> belongs to the preceding understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>, not to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط</span> is omitted.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا يخرجْ معهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يخرجَ معهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يخرجون معهم</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which pair meets the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط ماض لفظًا أو معنًى</span> when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> meet?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جئتَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض لفظًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم تأتِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض معنًى: لم تجزم المضارع، وتأتِ مجزوم بحذف حرف العلة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> concerns the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط</span> in this construction.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجيءُ / إن سوف تجيءُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن جئتَ / إن لم تأتِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا / لعلّ خالدًا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجواب الثاني محذوف لدلالة جواب الأول عليه</span>.</b> In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والله إن جئت لأكرمنّك</span></b>, which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> is omitted?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القسم</span> is first, so <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأكرمنّك</span></b> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>. It indicates the omitted <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط</span></b>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا الجوابين؛ فلا جواب مذكور</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو</span>", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Keep two levels of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span></h2><p>We analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة</span> as a whole</b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>. Another account focuses on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> alone; use the whole-expression account here. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عفوتُ عن خالدٍ</span></b> contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ مجرورًا بعن</span>, while <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عن خالد</span></b> occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موضع المفعول به</span>. The internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> stays.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\">One <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موضع رفع</span> and seven <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مواضع نصب</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موضع شبه الجملة</span></th><th>Example</th><th>Relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل: رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بزيدٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بزيد</span> occupies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span> position</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق: نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعرفونه كما يعرفون أبناءهم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كما يعرفون أبناءهم</span> describes the manner/likeness of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما مصدرية</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به: نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عفا الله عنك</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عنك</span> supplies what the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عفو</span> concerns</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول فيه: نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ في البيتِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span> locates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلوس</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول له: نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هربتُ للخوفِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للخوف</span> supplies the reason</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول معه: نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافرتُ مع خالدٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع خالد</span> gives the accompanying person</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال: نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ادخلوها بسلامٍ آمنين</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بسلام</span> describes the manner of entering</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز: نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفيضُ من الدمعِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الدمع</span> identifies what the overflowing consists of</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع المفعول معه</span></b> describes the function of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع خالد</span>; it does not turn <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو المعية</span> or make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد منصوبًا</span>. Likewise, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عنك</span> is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> with a visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>. Keep the chosen analysis of the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> distinct from its components.</p><p>For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبب</span> expressed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل, جر</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> is preferred: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هربتُ للخوفِ</span></b>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>, both forms stand: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هربتُ خوفَ الأسدِ / لخوفِ الأسدِ</span></b>. This does not mean that every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> can freely become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا له</span>: the required causal relationship must hold.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بزيدٍ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Zayd was brought.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء: فعل ماض مجهول مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء: حرف جر؛ زيدٍ: اسم مجرور بالباء وعلامة جرّه الكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بزيد: جار ومجرور، ظرف لغو، في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span> in the whole-expression analysis used here.</li></ul><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ في البيتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلست فعل وفاعل؛ في حرف جر؛ البيتِ مجرور بالكسرة؛ في البيت ظرف لغو متعلق بجلست، في موضع المفعول فيه، في محل نصب</span>. The role of the whole expression does not erase <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر البيت</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s4\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Keep two levels of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "One <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موضع رفع</span> and seven <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مواضع نصب</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> to its position, using the whole-expression account.", "sol": "<p>The whole expressions supply <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل، المفعول به، المفعول فيه، المفعول له</span></b> respectively. Their internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورات</span> remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورة</span>; a whole-expression <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span> never changes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عنك</span> into a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب كاف</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بزيدٍ: بزيد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب خبر كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عفا الله عنك: عنك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع خبر إنّ، محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع المفعول به، محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع نائب الفاعل، محل رفع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلس خالد في البيت: في البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع التمييز فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع خبر خالد، محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع المفعول فيه، محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هربت للخوف: للخوف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع خبر كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع الفاعل، محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع المفعول له، محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو</span> functions.", "sol": "<p>All four whole expressions occupy <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مواضع نصب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق، المفعول معه، الحال، التمييز</span></b>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كما يعرفون</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف حرف جر وما مصدرية؛</span> the comparison describes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع خالد</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>, not a visibly <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب مفعول معه</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعرفونه كما يعرفون أبناءهم: كما يعرفون أبناءهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع المفعول المطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافرتُ مع خالدٍ: مع خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع المفعول معه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع فاعل سافر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع نائب الفاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ادخلوها بسلام آمنين: بسلام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع مبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفيض من الدمع: من الدمع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع التمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع خبر كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع نائب الفاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of the unfamiliar expression with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجهول</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بسعيدٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مجهول؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالكسرة</span>. In the whole-expression account, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بسعيد</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع نائب فاعل</span>. Do not change <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مجهول مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع معلوم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الجواب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالباء وعلامته الكسرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بسعيد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the accurate account of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هربتُ خوفَ الأسدِ / هربتُ لخوفِ الأسدِ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> expresses the reason and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خوفَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول له</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لخوفِ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر باللام</span> and the whole expression occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موضع المفعول له</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للخوف</span></b> is preferred.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["Both require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خوفٌ</span> because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> is forbidden whenever <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خوف</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.", "Both are permitted here; with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المصدر المضاف</span> the two forms stand."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بزيدٍ, زيد</span> must become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيدٌ</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بزيد</span> occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span>.”", "sol": "<p>The internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> still governs its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع</span></b> belongs to the whole expression in the analysis used here.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["Remove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> in every such construction.", "Change <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span> while keeping the same analysis.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيدٍ</span> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا بالباء</span>; the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بزيد</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في موضع المفعول معه</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع خالد</span> means:", "sol": "<p>The functional position and the internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> must both be stated. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف منصوب وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع</span> becomes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> must have a visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>.", "The whole expression supplies that relationship; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافًا إليه</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">The understood general meaning</h2><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ في البيتِ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span> completes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> through an understood general meaning such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كائن</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلس خالدٌ في البيت</span></b>, it attaches to the specific <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جلس</span>. This distinction is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ / ظرف لغو</span></b>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span></th><th>Example</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر المبتدأ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ في البيتِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا في البيتِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر الفعل الناقص</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ في البيتِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ خالدًا في البيتِ، أي كائنًا فيه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت، بالتبعية</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ برجلٍ في البيتِ، أي كائنٍ فيه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر؛</span> it follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>In these analyses, “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر</span>” is shorthand for its role with the omitted general <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعلَّق</span>. The ordinary roles of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت</span> remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا عندَ البابِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid is at the door.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ: حرف مشبّه بالفعل؛ خالدًا: اسم إنّ منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندَ: ظرف مكان منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البابِ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند الباب: شبه جملة، ظرف مستقرّ، متعلق بمحذوف، في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>.</li></ul><p>The whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع</span> while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند</span> has a visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>. Do not replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندَ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندُ</span> to force agreement with the outer role.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">An omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span></h2><p>With a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span> containing <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span> may be omitted when understood. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وإنْ منكم إلّا واردُها</span></b> is understood with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحدٌ كائنٌ منكم</span></b>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية</span></b>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطية. منكم</span> supplies a description of the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد</span>; do not automatically call it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرًا</span> just because the described <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is absent.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s4\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "The understood general meaning"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "An omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and the outer role.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلس</span></b> supplies a specific <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعلَّق</span>, so the first is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغو</span>. The others complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرًا</span> with an omitted general meaning: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر المبتدأ وخبر إنّ</span></b> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلس خالد في البيت: في البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو متعلق بجلس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر خبر خالد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة موصول</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد في البيت: في البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت لخالد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر في محل رفع خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو متعلق بفعل جلس مذكور</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا في البيت: في البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالد في البيت: في البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر في محل نصب خبر كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع اسم كان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ هندًا عندَ البابِ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف منصوب ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البابِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند الباب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر متعلق بمحذوف في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of the whole does not replace the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان منصوب وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع لفظًا بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البابِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية في محل جزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل نصب اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the endings in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان المسافر <span class=\"blank\"></span> <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>: the words are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان المسافرُ عندَ البابِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافر اسم كان مرفوع؛ عند ظرف منصوب ومضاف؛ الباب مضاف إليه مجرور؛ عند الباب في محل نصب خبر كان</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندَ البابِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندُ البابُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندِ البابَ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وإنْ منكم إلّا واردُها</span></b>, choose the account of the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> includes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحدٌ كائنٌ منكم</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> can describe an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span>; omission does not remove the relationship.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ شرطية، ومنكم جوابها المجزوم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ نافية؛ أحدٌ</span> is understood, described by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منكم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منكم</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> because its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span> is omitted."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت خالدًا في البيت</span></b> the question explicitly means “Khalid, being in the house.” Classify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span>.", "sol": "<p>The question fixes the descriptive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span> to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: the understood meaning is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كائنًا في البيت</span></b>, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>. Establish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span> before applying the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> pattern.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو</span> locating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span>, despite the specified meaning.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر في محل نصب حال من خالد</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت لخالد في محل جر</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يحذف الموصوف</span></b> licenses which conclusion?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span></b> states a possible construction, not a rule requiring omission everywhere. Recover the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span> only where the wording and meaning support it.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> must have a deleted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span>.", "An understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span> may still determine the role of its description.", "A missing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span> changes all <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف الجر</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "Choosing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزع الخافض</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Establish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span> before applying a pattern</h2><p>These patterns concern a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span> describing the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></b>. They do not say that every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> after a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ في البيتِ</span></b> attaches to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلست</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ في البيتِ</span></b> supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرًا</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Pattern</th><th>Example</th><th>Analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الجنة</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسألُ اللهَ الفردوسَ في الجنّةِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفردوس</span></td></tr><tr><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة محضة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسألُ اللهَ بيتًا في الجنّةِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت لبيت، في محل نصب</span></td></tr><tr><td>Before that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>, describing it</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسألُ اللهَ في الجنّةِ بيتًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مقدّمة</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتًا</span></td></tr><tr><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير محضة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقال رجلٌ مؤمنٌ من آل فرعون</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من آل فرعون</span> may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعتًا أو حالًا</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حكم النكرة</span>, so it does not serve as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> of an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span> follows that pattern. The generic expression <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حكم النكرة</span> in Lesson 4 remains a distinct case.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">Meaning does not replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من البيانية</span></b> may explain the kind meant by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>, functioning like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> in meaning while remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حالًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وما تقدّموا لأنفسكم من خير</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من خير</span> is explanatory and receives the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> analysis here. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاجتنبوا الرجسَ من الأوثان</span></b> likewise has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الأوثان</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أساور من ذهب</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من ذهب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة أساور</span>.</p><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>-like meaning also need not be actual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ الصفحةَ من الكتابِ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الكتاب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ صفحةً من الكتابِ</span></b> has it as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستقرّها</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستقرّ لها</span></b>: expressing the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> allows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستقرّ</span> to remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> may carry the understood meaning of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام، من</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنصوب بنزع الخافض</span></h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> may be omitted and the following expression take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>, called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزع الخافض، حذف وإيصال، اتّساع</span></b>. This is a recognised construction, not permission to delete any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> you choose.</p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأقعدنّ لهم صراطَك المستقيمَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صراطَك منصوب بنزع الخافض؛ التقدير على صراطك. صراطَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف، والكاف مضاف إليه؛ المستقيمَ نعت منصوب</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أوعجبتم أنْ جاءكم ذكرٌ من ربّكم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التقدير مِنْ أن جاءكم؛ أنْ وما بعدها مصدر مؤوّل في محل نصب بنزع الخافض</span>. There is no visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> on the whole expression. This <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span>, distinct from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ التفسيرية</span>.</li></ul><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ صفحةً من الكتابِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I read a page from the book.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ: فعل ماض مبني على السكون؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفحةً: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، نكرة محضة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من: حرف جر؛ الكتابِ: اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الكتاب: شبه جملة، ظرف مستقرّ متعلق بمحذوف، في محل نصب نعت لصفحة</span>.</li></ul><p>Change only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفحةً</span> to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفحةَ</span></b>: with the same descriptive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق, من الكتاب</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال</span>. The outer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>, but the grammatical relationship changes.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s5\">Arabic reading</h2>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Establish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span> before applying a pattern"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "Meaning does not replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنصوب بنزع الخافض</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s5", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> describes the named <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> with an understood general meaning. Choose its role.", "sol": "<p>After <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span></b> the descriptive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>; after <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة محضة</span></b> it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. When placed before the described <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مقدّمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مؤمن</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير محضة</span>, so both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> are possible for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من آل فرعون</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسأل الله الفردوسَ في الجنة: في الجنة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر في محل رفع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسأل الله بيتًا في الجنة: في الجنة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه في محل جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسأل الله في الجنة بيتًا: في الجنة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت متقدّم في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مقدّمة في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مؤمن من آل فرعون: من آل فرعون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يجوز نعت ولا حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز نعت أو حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب خبر كان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish meaning from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> in the stated analyses.", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>-like meaning does not erase the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفحة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>, giving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفحة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>, giving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من خير</span></b> receives the stated explanatory <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> analysis. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من ذهب</span></b> describes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة أساور</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت الصفحةَ من الكتاب: من الكتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور وحده بلا من</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال، مع معنى الإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت صفحةً من الكتاب: من الكتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت، مع معنى الإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال واجبة لأن صفحة معرفة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تقدّموا لأنفسكم من خير: من خير، على التحليل البياني</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيان معنى، وحال إعرابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أساور من ذهب: من ذهب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال واجبة من معرفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت للنكرة أساور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لذهب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A new example: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتريتُ قلمًا من الخشبِ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخشب</span> = wood. Treat <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الخشب</span> as describing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلمًا</span>, not as attached to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتريت</span>. Its role is:", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلمًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة محضة</span>. The descriptive <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الخشب</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر في محل نصب نعت؛ الخشبِ</span> is internally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بمن</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر اشتريت</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال واجبة من معرفة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب نعت لقلم</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزع الخافض</span> in the established expressions.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صراطَك</span></b> shows visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> after understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقيمَ</span> follows it as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن جاءكم ذكر</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span> after understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>; its whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> has no visible ending. These are instances of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزع الخافض</span></b>; do not generalise them into deleting arbitrary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف جر</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأقعدنّ لهم صراطَك المستقيمَ: صراطك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا بعلى المكتوبة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا بنزع الخافض؛ التقدير على صراطك</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أوعجبتم أن جاءكم ذكر من ربكم: أن وما بعدها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع فاعل عجبتم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن تفسيرية لا تأويل لها هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل في محل نصب بنزع الخافض؛ التقدير من أن جاءكم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف وإيصال / اتّساع، هنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع استعمال حروف الجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمان لهذا الحذف مع النصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الفاعل من كل فعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “Any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> after a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>.”", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة/نكرة</span> pattern applies to a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر</span> describing the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></b>. It does not override <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلق بفعل</span>. A qualified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> may allow both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>.</p>", "group": "9R|Review", "opts": ["First establish descriptive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق: خالد في البيت</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, whereas the stated description of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيته في البيت</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> regardless of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>.", "Correct; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> can never be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد نكرة غير محضة احتملت النعت والحال</span></b> means:", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير محضة</span></b> is essential: a qualification such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤمن</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مؤمن</span> changes the possibilities. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> says <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احتملت</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجبت</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> is always compulsory after any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> is impossible after a qualified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.", "Both analyses may be allowed; specify one or state both when testing it."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: Putting the relationships together", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Work from the whole passage to its smaller units. Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>, establish internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, then state the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>. The passages use fewer supplied vowel marks; add the required endings mentally before choosing.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل مسافر يحمل حقيبة. قال: الطريق طويل والجو بارد</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حقيبة</span> = bag. The second quoted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوفة على الأولى</span>. Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسافرٌ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ونكرة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحمل حقيبةً</span></b> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت في محل رفع</span>, linked by hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطريقُ طويلٌ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقول القول في محل نصب</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجوُّ باردٌ</span></b> follows it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالعطف في محل نصب</span>. Internally, each quoted statement has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ وخبر مرفوعان</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Connected reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل مسافر يحمل حقيبة، في بدء الكلام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مقول القول</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحمل حقيبة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع نعت لمسافر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال من معرفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: جواب قسم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطريق طويل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: صلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل قال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مقول القول</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجو بارد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم جواب الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب بالعطف على مقول القول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Continue: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان المسافر عند الباب. دخل وهو يبتسم</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يبتسم</span> = smiles. Identify the target.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان المسافرُ عندَ البابِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافر اسم كان؛ عند ظرف منصوب ومضاف؛ الباب مضاف إليه؛ عند الباب خبر كان في محل نصب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخل</span></b> has hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يبتسم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> with required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يبتسم</span></b> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is internally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر هو في محل رفع</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Connected reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر في محل نصب خبر كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل جزم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يبتسم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية في محل نصب حال</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يبتسم، مع فاعله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم جواب قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب خبر كان مباشرة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبب واو الحال</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مضارع يحتاج إلى واو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو هي الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاسمية مصدّرة بضمير صاحب الحال</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the repair or ending that preserves each intended structure.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف تفهمُ</span></b> remains internally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا</span> despite the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> having <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> inside <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندَ</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب ظرف</span> inside <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يتأخّرون</span></b> answers the understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تحفظْ فسوف تفهمْ</span>: repair <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهمُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهمَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهمِ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ يقرأَ</span>: repair <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأِ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ هندًا عندُ الباب</span>: repair <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندٌ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لئن حضروا لا يتأخّروا،</span> intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب قسم</span>: repair", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا يتأخّرْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يتأخّرون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يتأخّرَ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which comparison is sound? <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ تنجحْ / إن تجتهدْ فأنت ناجحٌ / والله لأجتهدنّ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The first has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجزوم</span> but no linking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة</span> for the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>. The second answers a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط جازم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>. The third answers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسمًا</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> does not assign a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["All three entire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجوبة</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم</span>.", "The first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>, the second has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span>, and the third is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب قسم لا محل له</span>.", "All three entire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجوبة</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ تجتهدْ فأنتَ ناجحٌ</span></b>. Account for every unit and the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجتهدْ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط مجزوم بالسكون وفاعله مستتر أنت؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة للجواب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ في محل رفع؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناجحٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت ناجح</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم جواب شرط جازم مقترن بالفاء</span>. The complete construction, as an opening statement, has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب and nested relationships", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبّه بالفعل ينصب أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجتهدْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بالسكون، فعل الشرط</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل تجتهد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناجح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر تقديره أنت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة للجواب لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناجحٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجزوم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت ناجح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: جواب قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية في محل جزم جواب الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ صفحةً من الكتابِ</span></b>. Treat <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الكتاب</span> as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفحة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل وفاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفحةً</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب ونكرة محضة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالكسرة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الكتاب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصف لصفحة بمتعلَّق عام محذوف، في محل نصب نعت</span>. The complete statement at the start of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية لا محل لها</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب and nested relationships", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأ، في قرأت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تأنيث لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفحةً</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بمن وعلامته الكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الكتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقر متعلق بمحذوف في محل نصب نعت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "C3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بطالب مجتهد في المسجد. قال الطالب: إن أدرس فسوف أفهم</span>.</b> For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في المسجد</span>, use the permitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> analysis describing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب مجتهد</span>. Analyse the targets.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبٍ مجتهدٍ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير محضة</span>; both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> may be considered, but this task explicitly selects <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span></b>, hence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جر</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في المسجد</span>. The entire reported <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقول القول في محل نصب</span></b>, containing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم</span></b> and an internal <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهمُ مرفوع</span></b>. These three levels coexist.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب and nested relationships", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في المسجد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال واجبة بلا بديل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر نعت، على التحليل المطلوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن أدرس فسوف أفهم، بكاملها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مقول القول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر صلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل قال</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوف أفهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها: جواب قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم جواب شرط جازم مقترن بالفاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به أدرس</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهم، بعد سوف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهمْ: مجزوم بسوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهمُ: مضارع مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهمَ: منصوب بالفاء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يلزم من كون الجملة في محل نصب أن يكون فعلها منصوبًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر المثال المطابق</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة، وفاعله ضمير مستتر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع فاعله جملة في محل نصب خبر كان. لا يلزم</span> means “it does not follow.”</p>", "group": "D|Arabic grammatical reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ: جملة فعلية تامّة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ يقرأُ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يقرأَ خالدٌ: كل جملة فيها لن خبر كان</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنصوب بنزع الخافض قد يكون نصبه لفظيًّا أو محلّيًّا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر المقابلة الصحيحة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صراطَك</span></b> shows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف على</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن جاءكم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل في محل نصب</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف من</span> in the stated expression. An omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> and the resulting <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> are both part of the analysis.</p>", "group": "D|Arabic grammatical reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صراطِك: نصب لفظي بالكسرة بعد على مكتوبة؛ أن تفسيرية دائمًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صراطَك: نصب لفظي؛ أن جاءكم، بعد عجبتم: نصب محلّي على التأويل المذكور</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل منصوب بنزع الخافض فاعل مرفوع</span>."], "ans": 1}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>You should be able to distinguish internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of a whole expression; justify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الجواب</span>; identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجمل التي لا محل لها</span>; distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لغو</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span>; and separate the meaning of a relationship from its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. Revisit any incorrect answer by naming the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> you missed, then analyse the example again without the options.</p>"}], "revisit": ""};
